WEBVTT

00:04:37.771 --> 00:04:41.000
Take your finger and draw this line.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:45.000
Summer, fall, winter, spring,

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:51.237
noon, dusk, dark, dawn.

00:04:51.237 --> 00:04:54.500
Have you ever seen those stratus clouds

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.173
that go in parallel stripes across the sky?

00:04:57.173 --> 00:04:59.768
Did you know that's a continuous sheet of cloud

00:04:59.768 --> 00:05:03.365
that's dipping in and out of the condensation layer?